{
  "abstract": "This is a Lean 4 formalization of the two papers \n\"Sharp isoperimetric inequalities on the Hamming cube II: The\ncritical exponent\" by P. Durcik, P. Ivanisvili, J. Roos and X. Xie,\nand \"Sharp isoperimetric inequalities on the Hamming cube near the\ncritical exponent\" by P. Durcik, P. Ivanisvili and J. Roos.\nThe central result of this sequence of two papers is a sharp isoperimetric\ninequality on the Hamming cube at the critical exponent.\nAdditional results include the resolution of a conjecture of Kahn and Park on\ncube partitions, a sharp L^1 Poincare inequality for Boolean-valued functions\nand some improved isoperimetric inequalities for large subsets of the Hamming cube.\nThe structure of the formalization closely follows the structure of the paper and most\nmathematical claims of the two papers are represented by Lean statements within the repository.\nThe Lean code was generated by coding agents.",
